  accTitle: Separate training, selection and final scoring data
  accDescr: Training data updates adapters and creates candidate checkpoints. Validation evaluates those candidates and selects by a predeclared rule. After selection, held-out data supplies final scores. It does not update or select checkpoints.
  T["300 train examples"] --> U["Adapter updates → candidate checkpoints"]
  U --> S["Select by declared validation rule"]
  V["50 validation examples"] --> S
  S --> E["Final frozen evaluation"]
  H["100 held-out examples"] --> E
